    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f014dda0b328592dcb719f5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然平常都不能像这样放纵，\n但说不定今天这样子才是真正的我呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad0c53575197d591f92cc7b5fd11c5e1e64dc6b8bc2b67332c328ffea2bc3fb7",
