    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70263fd87bb5f9a65ab9270f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "听她这么说，我没有异议地表示赞同。\n我们一起付出了多到难以想像的努力，\n才有了今天的成果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a0ec76f8c288a38167666d15afdaf14c20577029588f70359a0f504d15e8a51",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
