      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我在这段时光中，\n深刻地感受到了\n与北部玄驹之间无可取代的情谊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "aebb6d79cb79da09095801b47aa05ed349b71e8e5529d9cf420511ff91dfc602",
